        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Please teach your van drivers how to drive. On July 16th at 12pm on highway 20 a van was driving 1 foot away from the back of my Vehicle  in a construction zone. If I had to emergency stop he would have crashed into my car. Here is the license plate number FSG9365.\n\nDo better. That was so unsafe. My 3 year old was in the car and they need to learn to drive safely.",
